[8] Being aggrieved and dissatisfied with the award passed by the learned L.A Judge, the appellant has filed this instant appeal seeking the following relief :
Smt. Alpana Dutta Wife Of Sri Chinmoy ... vs The Chief Engineer on 11 January, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/102390881/
2 "(i) Admit the appeal;
(ii) Call for the records;
(iii) Issue notice upon the claimant-respondent;

(iv) After hearing the parties, be pleased to allow this appeal enhancing the compensation for acquired land in terms of claims made under Section 18 of the Act of 1894;
(v) Pass any other order/orders as your Lordship may deem fit and proper in the circumstances of the case."
[9] Mr. K.K. Pal, learned counsel appearing for the claimant- appellant submits that the learned L.A Judge committed an error in determining the market value of the acquired land and misinterpreted the judgment of this Court passed in L.A. No.08 of 2019 and L.A No.09 of 2013.
